# prd.json Template

Copy this JSON structure to `prd.json` at your project root. Replace all `{{PLACEHOLDER}}` values.

```json
{
  "version": "1.0",
  "project": "{{PROJECT_NAME}}",
  "generatedAt": "{{ISO_TIMESTAMP}}",
  "totalStories": 1,
  "totalStoryPoints": 3,
  "sprints": 1,
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "E1-S1",
      "title": "{{STORY_TITLE}}",
      "epic": "E1",
      "sprint": "S1",
      "storyPoints": 3,
      "riskLevel": "MEDIUM",
      "storyType": "backend",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "AC1: {{FIRST_CRITERION}}",
        "AC2: {{SECOND_CRITERION}}"
      ],
      "passes": false,
      "notes": "",
      "model": "sonnet",
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "priority": "P0",
      "dependencies": [],
      "keyFiles": ["{{PATH_TO_KEY_FILE}}"],
      "techSpecFile": null,
      "implementedDate": null
    }
  ],
  "gates": [
    {
      "id": "GATE:{{GATE_NAME}}",
      "name": "{{GATE_DISPLAY_NAME}}",
      "triggerStory": "E1-S1",
      "unlocked": false,
      "blocksEpics": [],
      "description": "{{GATE_DESCRIPTION}}"
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "source": "ralph-bridge",
    "artifacts": []
  }
}
```

## Field Reference

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `id` | string | Unique story ID (format: `E{epic}-S{story}`) |
| `passes` | boolean | `true` when story is complete and verified |
| `notes` | string | Empty, or prefixed: `BLOCKED:`, `DEFERRED:`, `Manual:` |
| `dependencies` | string[] | Story IDs (`E1-S2`) or gate IDs (`GATE:NAME`) |
| `techSpecFile` | string\|null | Path to generated tech spec, or null |
| `implementedDate` | string\|null | ISO date string when completed |
